00:37:54.320 --> 00:38:01.040
<v Ira Glass>Right. If you're up against another lawyer, it's like watching two boxers box each other.
<v Ira Glass>对。如果你面对的是另一位律师，那就像看两个拳击手对垒。

00:38:01.040 --> 00:38:13.380
<v Francisco Calderon>And, like I indicated, there's expected to be give and take. And in this instance, there really was not, and there's nothing sympathetic about what I'm doing here.
<v Francisco Calderon>而且，正如我所指出的，人们预期会有来有往。而在这种情况下，确实没有，而且我在这里做的事情没有任何令人同情的成分。

00:38:13.380 --> 00:38:19.250
<v Ira Glass>Did you know what the court-appointed attorney was going to do as his defense? Did he talk to you about it afterwards?
